               <http://www.isocat.org/ns/dcr.rdf#datcat> <http://www.isocat.org/datcat/DC-1959>;
               a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
               rdfs:comment "Indication specifying whether the usage is old or modern.";
               rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.lexinfo.net/ontology/2.0/lexinfo>;
               rdfs:label "dating";
               rdfs:range lexinfo:Dating;
               rdfs:subPropertyOf <http://lemon-model.net/lemon#property>;
               <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1:0".
